 ```
 
+### Configuration for Kubelet Stats (`/metrics`)
+
+The `kubeletStats` preset scrapes each node's kubelet `/metrics` endpoint (`https://${env:K8S_NODE_NAME}:10250/metrics`) using a `prometheus/kubelet_stats` receiver authenticated with the service-account bearer token (`insecure_skip_verify: true`). It is disabled by default and requires `mode: daemonset` on a Kubernetes distribution. Further receiver customization can be supplied via `config` overrides.
+
+```yaml
+mode: daemonset
+presets:
+  kubeletStats:
+    enabled: true
+    scrapeInterval: 30s
+```
+
 ### Configuration for Kubernetes Cluster Metrics
 
 The collector can be configured to collects cluster-level metrics from the Kubernetes API server. A single instance of this receiver can be used to monitor a cluster.
